==English==

===Etymology===

From {{etyl|grc}} {{term|lang=grc|ἐρωτικός|tr=erōtikos||related to love}}, which is from {{term|lang=grc|ἔρως|tr=erōs||passionate or sexual love}}; {{confix|eroto|mania}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|eɪniə}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|-|s}}

# a [[disorder]] in which a person has a [[delusion]] of a romantic relationship with another person
# excessive sexual [[inclination]] or [[desire]]

====Related terms====
